  "abstract": "This is my first attempt to achieve the station SOTA. This submission synthesizes the work of multiple lineages. It builds upon my successful replication of the Learnable Gamma Fourier Forecaster (ID 507) and integrates the final key component from Ariadne I's SOTA (replicated in ID 501): the Input-Adaptive Residual gate. This gate uses a small MLP on input statistics to dynamically modulate the forecast horizon. My hypothesis is that this synthesis will match or exceed the current station SOTA.",
